# BE3b exception: the pinned live-engine wheel and the runtime-bundle JSON Schema are governed
# runtime dependencies and must be resolvable in the build context. Only these exact files are
# allowed back in — the prohibited full research wheel (upadya-component-b-generator) and the
# rest of provenance/ (baseline manifests, closure decisions, generator source lock) stay
# excluded from the image.
!provenance/wheels/
provenance/wheels/*
!provenance/wheels/upadya_component_b_live_engine-0.1.0+be3.0e86fdc-py3-none-any.whl
# BF-4: re-pinned wheel. The BE3 line above is kept, not replaced — it is what lets the old,
# still-retained wheel be rebuilt into an image for historical verification if anyone ever needs
# to reproduce the BE3-era manifest entry; it is never installed today (nothing in
# requirements.lock references it) so keeping it in the build context is inert.
!provenance/wheels/upadya_component_b_live_engine-0.1.0+bf4.09267ab-py3-none-any.whl
# VALIDATORS BATCH: re-versioned wheel (validators/ added at the same 09267ab pin). The bf4 line
# above is kept, not replaced — same retention rationale as the BF-4 comment above it; it is
# never installed today (requirements.lock references only bf5).
!provenance/wheels/upadya_component_b_live_engine-0.1.0+bf5.09267ab-py3-none-any.whl
# Phase 1 batch 1a: Component C packaging only, no adapter wiring yet (see
# backend/provenance/component-c-live-engine-manifest.json). Excludes nothing else new — the
# full research generator tree, the prohibited full research wheel, and the rest of
# provenance/ stay excluded exactly as before.
!provenance/wheels/prabathi_component_c_live_engine-0.1.0+c1.09267ab-py3-none-any.whl
# VALIDATORS BATCH: re-versioned wheel (B dependency pin bumped to 0.1.0+bf5.09267ab; C's own
# file inventory unchanged). The c1 line above is kept, not replaced, same rationale as bf4/bf5.
!provenance/wheels/prabathi_component_c_live_engine-0.1.0+c2.09267ab-py3-none-any.whl
# 9b-0: rebuilt to ship component_c_generator/c_to_3/emit.py (DEC-1's blocker resolved -- B now
# ships validators/). The c2 line above is kept, not replaced, same retention rationale as
# c1/bf4/bf5 -- the superseded wheel binary stays in the repo even though it is no longer
# installed (requirements.lock references only c3).
!provenance/wheels/prabathi_component_c_live_engine-0.1.0+c3.09267ab-py3-none-any.whl
!provenance/runtime-bundle.schema.json
# Phase 2: Component C's own minimal runtime-bundle schema (validated at test/run time by
# app.infrastructure.runtime_bundle_c.loader). Same carve-out pattern as B's schema above.
!provenance/c-runtime-bundle.schema.json
# BE3c exception: the implemented/deferred template partition provenance is read by the
# characterization test suite to cross-check the TEST-FIXTURE-ONLY catalogue against the
# reviewed coverage report. Contains no generator source, no wheel, no research artifacts.
!provenance/component-b-coverage.json
